From: thinkthoughts <dth26b@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:41:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] V0: the variational space B21 has dimension exactly 846

Transcribes B21 = span_Q{(L - P1)^a P_lambda : lambda even parts,
a + |lambda| <= 21} over the 45 rescaled coordinates, proves the
partition identity sum_j p(j)(22 - 2j) = 846 (p = Mathlib's Nat.Partition
count via a verified enumeration), an explicit 846-element index type
with no duplicates and exact coverage, algebraic independence of the
power sums P1..P45 over Q, and finrank B21 = 846. Prepares V1 with the
algebraic identities of the simplex moment formula (10.1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DyEq5SJg3P8RhuwC4Kgon8
