+next_development:
+  V1: >
+    The simplex moment identity (10.1) as an integral: ∫_{z ≥ 0, Σz ≤ R} ∏ zᵢ^{eᵢ} dz =
+    simplexMoment R e, by induction on m through simplexMoment_snoc, Fubini, and the Beta
+    integral ∫₀^R z^u (R − z)^v dz = betaMoment R u v (Mathlib MeasureTheory /
+    intervalIntegral). Then Lemma 10.1 for rational polytopes.
